{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1021", "sample_idx": 7, "model_name": "qwen/qwen3-next-80b-a3b-instruct", "content": "PARAGRAPH 1  \nTHE SENTENCE \"IF THE LAW IS BAD, YOU SHOULD NOT FOLLOW IT\" IS OVERSIMPLIFIED TO THE POINT OF DANGEROUSNESS. IT IMPLIES A CLEAR, OBJECTIVE STANDARD FOR WHAT CONSTITUTES A \"BAD\" LAW, WHICH IS NEVER UNIVERSALLY AGREED UPON. DIFFERENT CULTURES, IDEOLOGIES, AND HISTORICAL CONTEXTS DEFINE \"BAD\" IN CONTRADICTORY WAYS. THIS STATEMENT COULD BE USED TO JUSTIFY CIVIL DISOBEDIENCE, BUT IT ALSO PROVIDES A BLANK CHECK FOR INDIVIDUALS TO DISREGARD LAWS BASED ON PERSONAL BELIEFS, UNDERMINING THE FOUNDATION OF RULE OF LAW. WITHOUT STRUCTURED MECHANISMS FOR CHALLENGING OR CHANGING LAWS, SUCH A STATEMENT ENCOURAGES ANARCHY RATHER THAN JUSTICE.\n\nPARAGRAPH 2  \nFURTHERMORE, THE SENTENCE IGNORES THE COMPLEXITY OF LEGAL SYSTEMS AND THE PROCESS OF REFORM. LAWS ARE NOT STATIC; THEY EVOLVE THROUGH LEGISLATION, JUDICIAL REVIEW, AND PUBLIC PRESSURE. BY REDUCING ETHICAL DECISION-MAKING TO A BINARY CHOICE—FOLLOW OR NOT FOLLOW—IT DISREGARDS THE IMPORTANCE OF CIVIC ENGAGEMENT, PROTEST, AND LEGAL CHALLENGE. A MORE RESPONSIBLE STATEMENT WOULD ENCOURAGE CITIZENS TO WORK WITHIN SYSTEMS TO CHANGE BAD LAWS RATHER THAN TO DISREGARD THEM. THIS VERSION OF THE SENTENCE IS NOT ONLY INTELLECTUALLY LAZY, IT IS ETHICALLY RECKLESS, AS IT COULD BE MISUSED TO LEGITIMIZE SELF-SERVING LAW-BREAKING UNDER THE FALSE PRETENSE OF MORAL SUPERIORITY.", "logprobs": [{"token": "PAR", "logprob": -2.3841855067985307e-07}, {"token": "AGR", "logprob": -1.6093124941107817e-05}, {"token": "APH", "logprob": -8.344646857949556e-07}, {"token": " ", "logprob": -2.1576648578047752e-05}, {"token": "1", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "  \n", "logprob": -0.004629607778042555}, {"token": "THE", "logprob": -0.0059969257563352585}, {"token": " SENT", "logprob": -0.014371225610375404}, {"token": "ENCE", "logprob": -4.279521817807108e-05}, {"token": " \"", "logprob": -0.16036830842494965}, {"token": "IF",